#
# The defect classes this distribution DECLARES (mtools:W629), planted one at a time by the
# `:mutants` runner: <module>|<name>|<pattern>|<replacement>|<scope>. A line that stops matching is a
# STALE declaration and fails the grid as UNAPPLIED.

# W604: the rendered mirror must pass the markdown bar's 120 columns; a wrap whose break condition
# never fires still renders every word and every table, and only a line-length check sees it.
src/mikemol/pathsforward/render.py|wrap-never-breaks|> WIDTH and current|> WIDTH * 100 and current|def=wrap
